// Dark Castle Modular Character Engine, prototype 02: rig data of the lab.
// Read by src/player/visual/rig/data.rs (examples/modular_character_engine.rs).
// The prototype 01 data is kept in history/rig_lab_01.ron.
//
// Joints: texel coordinates read on the approved frames, x right and y DOWN
// from the cell's top-left corner. 02 refinement:
//   - run #0, #2, #4: the N4-C marks (art-src/n4-sprite-machine/scripts/
//     run_poses.py), measured on the high-resolution video frames;
//   - run #1, #3, #5: measured by Claude on the high-resolution video frames
//     (art-src/n3-6-animation-proof/frames/video_050/054/058.png) through the
//     reduction mapping (canvas = video * 0.23661 + (-3, -5));
//   - shoulders on the shoulder ball (y 38 in the run) following the arm
//     swing on a smooth curve (x 60, 61, 61, 59.5, 58, 58.5), one far
//     shoulder for the whole run, the neck steady at x 63.5 (it moves less
//     than a texel in the art), the head on the N4-C head circle;
//   - run #4 fist on the fist's skin (51, 56): the N4-C mark (57, 58) lies on
//     the trousers;
//   - chest_* / waist_*: the torso box (N4-C torso polygons on #0, #2, #4).
// Estimate, about +-1 texel. Leg A is the rear leg in run frames 0-2 and the
// front leg in 3-5 (interpretation, as in N4-C).
// Approved art, read only:
//   idle: art-src/n3-8-production-run/stage/sprites/player/n35_idle.png
//   run:  art-src/n3-8-production-run/stage/sprites/player/n36_run6.png
(
    version: 1,
    rest_clip: "idle",
    clips: {
        // One approved idle pose; frame 1 lowers the upper body one texel
        // (breath, experimental: the legs stay planted).
        "idle": (
            texture: "approved://sprites/player/n35_idle.png",
